{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":107,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":["Book V "]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 107:1"},"O give thanks unto the LORD, for ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he is"]}," good: for his mercy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["endureth"]}," for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 107:2"},"Let the redeemed of the LORD say so, whom he hath redeemed from the hand of the enemy; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 107:3"},"And gathered them out of the lands, from the east, and from the west, from the north, and from the south. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 107:4"},"They wandered in the wilderness in a solitary way; they found no city to dwell in. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 107:5"},"Hungry and thirsty, their soul fainted in them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 107:6"},"Then they cried unto the LORD in their trouble, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he delivered them out of their distresses. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 107:7"},"And he led them forth by the right way, that they might go to a city of habitation. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 107:8"},"Oh that ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," would praise the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his goodness, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his wonderful works to the children of men! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 107:9"},"For he satisfieth the longing soul, and filleth the hungry soul with goodness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 107:10"},"Such as sit in darkness and in the shadow of death, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["being "]},"bound in affliction and iron; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 107:11"},"Because they rebelled against the words of God, and contemned the counsel of the most High: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 107:12"},"Therefore he brought down their heart with labour; they fell down, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there was"]}," none to help. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 107:13"},"Then they cried unto the LORD in their trouble, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he saved them out of their distresses. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 107:14"},"He brought them out of darkness and the shadow of death, and brake their bands in sunder. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 107:15"},"Oh that ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," would praise the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his goodness, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his wonderful works to the children of men! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 107:16"},"For he hath broken the gates of brass, and cut the bars of iron in sunder. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 107:17"},"Fools because of their transgression, and because of their iniquities, are afflicted. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 107:18"},"Their soul abhorreth all manner of meat; and they draw near unto the gates of death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 107:19"},"Then they cry unto the LORD in their trouble, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he saveth them out of their distresses. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 107:20"},"He sent his word, and healed them, and delivered ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them"]}," from their destructions. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 107:21"},"Oh that ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," would praise the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his goodness, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his wonderful works to the children of men! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 107:22"},"And let them sacrifice the sacrifices of thanksgiving, and declare his works with rejoicing. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 107:23"},"They that go down to the sea in ships, that do business in great waters; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:23"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PSA 107:24"},"These see the works of the LORD, and his wonders in the deep. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:24"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PSA 107:25"},"For he commandeth, and raiseth the stormy wind, which lifteth up the waves thereof. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:25"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PSA 107:26"},"They mount up to the heaven, they go down again to the depths: their soul is melted because of trouble. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:26"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PSA 107:27"},"They reel to and fro, and stagger like a drunken man, and are at their wit’s end. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:27"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PSA 107:28"},"Then they cry unto the LORD in their trouble, and he bringeth them out of their distresses. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:28"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PSA 107:29"},"He maketh the storm a calm, so that the waves thereof are still. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:29"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PSA 107:30"},"Then are they glad because they be quiet; so he bringeth them unto their desired haven. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:30"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PSA 107:31"},"Oh that ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," would praise the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his goodness, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," his wonderful works to the children of men! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:31"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PSA 107:32"},"Let them exalt him also in the congregation of the people, and praise him in the assembly of the elders. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:32"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PSA 107:33"},"He turneth rivers into a wilderness, and the watersprings into dry ground; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:33"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"34","sid":"PSA 107:34"},"A fruitful land into barrenness, for the wickedness of them that dwell therein. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:34"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"35","sid":"PSA 107:35"},"He turneth the wilderness into a standing water, and dry ground into watersprings. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:35"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"36","sid":"PSA 107:36"},"And there he maketh the hungry to dwell, that they may prepare a city for habitation; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:36"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"37","sid":"PSA 107:37"},"And sow the fields, and plant vineyards, which may yield fruits of increase. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:37"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"38","sid":"PSA 107:38"},"He blesseth them also, so that they are multiplied greatly; and suffereth not their cattle to decrease. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:38"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"39","sid":"PSA 107:39"},"Again, they are minished and brought low through oppression, affliction, and sorrow. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:39"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"40","sid":"PSA 107:40"},"He poureth contempt upon princes, and causeth them to wander in the wilderness, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["where there is"]}," no way. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:40"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"41","sid":"PSA 107:41"},"Yet setteth he the poor on high from affliction, and maketh ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him "]},"families like a flock. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:41"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"42","sid":"PSA 107:42"},"The righteous shall see ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it,"]}," and rejoice: and all iniquity shall stop her mouth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:42"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"43","sid":"PSA 107:43"},"Whoso ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wise, and will observe these ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things,"]}," even they shall understand the lovingkindness of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 107:43"}]}]}
